WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Mahri ji, aap yahan pe kis-kis bimari ki wajah se aaye the?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Sir, main dawa time pe nahi leti thi to mere ko pencil khane ka dil karta tha.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Aise hi doosre ke chalk wagairah lene ki bhi aadat si ho jati thi.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
To aap yahan pe kisko dikhane aaye the?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Sir, doctor ka naam...

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
31 Hooning sir.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
To ab unka ilaaj kab se chal raha hai?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Unka ilaaj to 4 saal se chal raha hai.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Kitna sudhaar lagta hai aapko?

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Sau percent sudhaar.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Aapko aisa lagta hai ki jo dawaai chalaai hai, woh sahi hai?

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Bilkul sahi chalaai hai, aur isliye aap theek ho gaye? Ab koi dikkat nahi rehti hai aapko?

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Nahi, koi dikkat nahi rehti hai. Sahi chalaai hai.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Aapko aisa lagta hai ki aur koi mareez hoga to aap unko recommend karenge na?

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Theek hai.
